WEBVTT

00:02:59.201 --> 00:03:02.057
i sve je to u paketu kojeg možete
držati u vašoj ruci.

00:03:02.517 --> 00:03:05.164
Tako da bismo htjeli napraviti
nešto tako,

00:03:05.178 --> 00:03:07.351
samo na staničnoj razini,

00:03:07.375 --> 00:03:08.823
u veličini papučice.

00:03:09.165 --> 00:03:10.587
I evo ga ovdje.

00:03:10.611 --> 00:03:13.240
Ovo je naš smartphone veličine stanice.

00:03:13.264 --> 00:03:15.349
Čak i izgleda kao smartphone,

00:03:15.373 --> 00:03:18.437
samo je oko 10 000 puta manji.

00:03:18.461 --> 00:03:20.350
Zovemo ga OWIC.

00:03:20.374 --> 00:03:23.283
[Optical Wireless Integrated Circuits]

00:03:23.307 --> 00:03:25.245
OK, nismo promotori, u redu?

00:03:25.269 --> 00:03:27.681
(Smijeh)

00:03:28.310 --> 00:03:30.222
Ali je fora samo po sebi.